=== HINT 1 ===
This exercise has no broken code - just read and understand it, then
remove "// I AM NOT DONE" to advance.

=== KEY CONCEPTS ===
_BitInt(N) - exactly N bits, signed.
unsigned _BitInt(N) - exactly N bits, unsigned.

Overflow behavior (same as standard integers):
  signed:   wraps in two's complement
  unsigned: wraps modulo 2^N

=== NOTE ===
_BitInt is supported in GCC 13+ and Clang 14+ with -std=c2x or -std=c23.
If compilation fails, your compiler may be too old - try upgrading.
